      "shortName": "model-multiple-icon-bearing-no",
      "title": "Model multiple icon-bearing notification actions",
      "status": "in-progress",
      "description": "In `heca/src/notification.rs`, replace `Option<NotificationAction>` with an ordered bounded collection (max 3); introduce stable NotificationActionId, NotificationActionVariant (Primary/Secondary/Destructive) and an icon representation compatible with plugin serialization. Enforce at most one Primary and preserve action ids through same-notification dedup updates. Intent remains name-keyed behavior only. Add domain tests for validation and late lookup by notification/action id.",
