      "shortName": "add-notificationsender-and-app",
      "title": "Add NotificationSender and app-thread notify event",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "Add a cloneable NotificationSender around EventLoopProxy<AppEvent> and an AppEvent payload carrying NotificationDraft. The app thread accepts the event, pushes through NotificationRuntime store, synchronizes visible specs/hints and requests redraw. Keep direct NotificationRuntime API for handlers with &mut AppState; sender users never receive AppState. Define result/ID semantics explicitly for asynchronous sends.",
